      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLITZEN BOO (8) was impressive last time, posting an effortless 2.5 lengths win in taking a Grade 6/MDN in 24.15 and a new Best time this course and distance. Rates a top chance again if runs up to latest. ROCKY RACCOON (4) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (24.23) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Likely to be in the finish again. EMERGENCY MAN (1) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a nose at this track in a handy 24.15 beating Dream House. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from eight starts. Leading player again. NEWTOWN BRETT (2) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
